  "title": "Unique Tunisian Pineapple Tagine",
  "description": "A sour and comforting Tunisian dish featuring pineapple chunks and lamination puff, made with ayurvedic tamasic friendly ingredients, this tagine is a perfect blend of flavors and textures.",
